Device files merged into UBports' unified recovery ramdisk (Halium 14,
generic_arm64) by boot/ut-init/build-boot-image.sh. See docs/roadmap-release.md,
item 1.

  init.recovery.qcom.rc     crDroid 14's own (USB controller, backlight), from
                            its boot ramdisk (recovery as boot)
  system/etc/recovery.fstab crDroid 14's, without /data (see the comment there)
  prop.append               USB ids and adb properties appended to prop.default;
                            fakecache off (userdata is not mounted in recovery)
  res/images                UBports' res-xxhdpi recovery UI images
                            (ubports/halium_bootable_recovery halium-14.0,
                            9cdb4a9; the default ramdisk has mdpi, too small
                            on this ~395 PPI screen; crDroid's stone recovery
                            uses the same xxhdpi menu font). font.png is
                            fonts/18x32.png there; its licence: res/OFL-fonts.txt

The recovery ramdisk itself is fetched by tools/fetch-recovery-ramdisk.sh.
